ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dmW2ftyRobIQ7kNvwFndVEC&_nc_oc=AdnmaYlu2gjObJWOuUrWBX2XT-0QKRIt7kowl6capHOJgcATZOsx9KF2LJGWF4uEO2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxuQTkC1l1zX86WM1sweZJxO9ZdoDnAHGsVW-18ZtBl3g&oe=69B54401"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GW0SMy7ZRZ4Q7kNvwGVFBLU&_nc_oc=AdkPTWXuls8d7MNDF8tAtcwFdqqf7pqimQTNbnCBRi4mHvK7vfV3-Nqo5qIhW-Csjko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxt9gI42U3K6J0CM420Qi9JJvOhEiZzgG8t7QWbwBfkbA&oe=69B55166"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jOp8vQB65eQQ7kNvwGCYipT&_nc_oc=AdlSv5d99GcS6MeH2VWHWfqvTateY2DMSHD-7tsdKXy53hDwnIAN9imKTA_GcEb2_wQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss